'''Griffin Burrows''' are a feature that only appear while the {{Dark Green|Mythological Ritual}} perk from {{NPCSprite|Diana}} is active. 

== Usage ==
'''Griffin Burrows''' can only be seen while the player is holding an {{Item|Ancestral Spade}}, {{Item|Archaic Spade}}, or {{Item|Deific Spade}}. The {{AN|Echo}} ability points the player in the direction of the nearest '''Griffin Burrow''': players can excavate these '''Burrows''', which will either uncover a {{mt|Mythological}} [[Mob]] or treasure. After defeating the [[Mob]] or claiming the treasure, an arrow pointing to the next '''Burrow''' in the chain appears.

For each rarity level the player's {{Item|Griffin Pet}} is, new creatures can spawn from '''Griffin Burrows'''. Each '''Griffin Burrow''' comes in chains of four, six, eight, or ten each. '''Burrows''' only spawn on grass blocks on the [[Hub Island]]. The treasure hunt consists of a number of steps, each listed below.
