When a '''Griffin Burrow''' displays an arrow, it will consist of {{Yellow|yellow}}, {{Red|red}}, or {{Dark Gray|black}} particles. The color telegraphs the player's distance from the next '''Burrow'''.

When digging up a {{mt|Mythological}} creature, the [[Mob]] must be defeated before the '''Burrow''' can be excavated to continue the chain.

The first '''Griffin Burrow''' is guaranteed to summon an arrow. All subsequent burrows have a {{Chance|75%|3|4}} chance to spawn a [[Mob]] and a {{Chance|25%|1|4}} chance to contain treasure.

